    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f1ba55cf-2c5c-59fa-9154-9713b0b1de0a" activityNameId="e54d13f1-5021-52f9-9caf-837f6d235427" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Flat glass plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Flat glass plant
The lifespan of the buildings and the land occupation is assumed to be 50 years and of the equipment (furnace (exkl. fireproof brick), float bath, annealing lehr, warehouse, stacking) 20 years. The module is based on a yearly production volume of 83'000 t/a;
Synonyms: Flachglasfabrik, Flach, plate; 
UUID: fcdd2055-16fc-34dc-ae0e-dd3cbb28d642
includes the infrastructure (multi-storey buildings and halls, tin initial load and equipment) and the land-use (built and not built areas)
Location: Data from one company in Germany is extrapolated to RER. For some exchanges CH-modules are used as proxy
Technology: Assumed data for average European plant
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire (one German company) 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fcdd2055-16fc-34dc-ae0e-dd3cbb28d642.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
